    {
      "text": "Figure 2 — Three phone mockups side by side, numbered 1-3: \"Low Fidelity Wireframe\" (grey sketch lines, boxes and circles), \"Mid Fidelity Wireframe\" (greyscale deals screen with \"Explore Featured Deals\", category circles such as coffee and pizza, and list items Starbucks, Tea Leaf, Espresso), and \"Final UI\" (a full-colour deals app with featured-deal banners, illustrated category icons and a Starbucks / The Coffee Bean & Tea Leaf / BARISTA Coffee list).",
      "state": "draft",
      "drafted_by": {
